! _POC-XRL2XE XE2(Cat8000v 17.15)= PE。コアの IS-IS と LDP だけ。お客さま側の IF は no shutdown だけ(L2VPN は PoC の段で足す)。
mpls label protocol ldp
mpls ldp router-id Loopback0 force
!
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.0.42 255.255.255.255
 ip router isis CORE
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description CORE to P1
 ip address 10.0.42.42 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description CE
 no ip address
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[2] }}
 description SW1 (dual-homed CE)
 no ip address
 no shutdown
!
router isis CORE
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0042.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 log-adjacency-changes
!
